---

## 🚀 How to Run

1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/amruthasai0524/python-hackerrank.git
```

2. Open the project folder

```bash
cd python-hackerrank
```

3. Run Python files

```bash
python filename.py
```

